Z||000006||Blacktree||12-24-2001||01:53 AM||||<B>Pheagy</B><P>There is a machine shop in Pine Hills called RevMaster. The guy that owns/runs the shop is Andy Williams... used to be one of my high school buddies. I haven't seen him in a couple years, not even sure if he'd even remember me, but he'll cut you a good deal on the head work for your 4-banger. <P>To give you an idea, I had him rebuild the cyl head on my 86 coupe a couple years ago and he charged me about $90 total for the job. That included the valve seals, hot tanking / magnafluxing the head, a 3-angle valve job, and new ARP head bolts.<P>You might want to look him up. RevMaster is just east of the intersection of Kirkman Rd and Old Winter Garden Rd, on Old Winter Garden Rd (in Pine Hills). His "sign" out front is a VW Bug sitting on a 20ft high pole with the word  "RevMaster" painted on the side.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Phone number is 407-295-7691. <BR><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.tweaktech.com" TARGET=_blank>Tweaktech</A>||||reg||1
